    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics is an intrinsic part of my intellectual curiosity—it’s neither a tool nor just abstract logic; it’s where I find patterns and precision in the world. As someone who enjoys problem-solving, it’s fulfilling to explore its structure, even if I don’t apply it daily in my part-time work.",
