    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year?": "Yes! Tools like Wolfram Alpha helped me visualize algebraic equations and verify step-by-step solutions, especially for those second-order ones I struggled with. It reduced frustration without replacing deep understanding—more like a co-pilot than a teacher.",
